---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";

// TODO(owner): review before publishing. Starting draft, not legal advice.
const updated = "4 September 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms that govern your use of Klica Technologies websites, exam preparation apps and services."
>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>
        These terms govern your use of the {site.name} website at {site.domain} and our
        exam preparation applications. By using them, you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Using our apps</h2>
      <p>
        We grant you a personal, non-transferable licence to install and use our apps for
        your own study. You may not resell, redistribute, decompile or repackage them, or
        strip out the advertising that funds the free versions.
      </p>

      <h2>Study content</h2>
      <p>
        Our practice questions are prepared for revision purposes. We work to keep them
        accurate and current, but we are not affiliated with JAMB, WAEC, NECO, or any
        university, and we do not guarantee that any particular question will appear in an
        examination. Nothing in our apps is an official examination product.
      </p>

      <h2>Institution names</h2>
      <p>
        Names such as JAMB, WAEC, NECO and the names of universities are used only to
        describe which examination an app prepares you for. They remain the property of
        their respective owners, and their use here does not imply endorsement.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The Klica name, logo, app content, question banks and website are owned by {site.name}
        and protected by copyright and trade mark law.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep the Services running, but we may change, suspend or withdraw any part
        of them. Apps are provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo;, without warranty of any kind.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, {site.name} is not liable for indirect or
        consequential loss arising from your use of the Services, including examination
        outcomes.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
